    logic: 'Two original irregular SVG paths sit behind one semantic text span. Stroke dash offset moves 390→0 over 900ms with a 110ms secondary offset, creating a layered hand-marker pass without importing Rough Notation code. Replay restarts only the two paths; reduced motion shows the completed highlight immediately.',
