    logic: 'A pill-shaped translucent navigation floats above an editorial canvas. Desktop links switch actual supporting copy and aria-current. Below 520px, a two-line menu button reveals the same links and CTA, updates aria-expanded and its accessible label. Card preview cycles selected destinations only while visible motion is allowed.',
